WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Moderator>Look at this concept for sharing context between support and success. Thoughts?</v>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>This is what I've been asking for. A shared view of the account that both teams work in. Right now I flag risk by hand in chat and the CSM misses it.</v>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>The activity feed shows tickets and CSM notes together. If my agents saw this they'd stop asking customers to repeat themselves.</v>

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
<v Moderator>What would you worry about?</v>

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:27.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>The health score. If it's green while my queue is on fire, nobody on my team will believe it. Show me how tickets affect it.</v>

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:50.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>Also I need a way to tell the CSM something is urgent without a chat message. A risk flag that shows on the account.</v>

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:14.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>Early warning is the thing I'd pay for. Five tickets in a week from one account should tell the CSM before the customer does.</v>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.000
<v Moderator>How would your reporting change?</v>

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.000
<v Lucia Ferreira>I'd stop exporting tickets every Monday if leadership could see this themselves.</v>

